From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 21:00:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 008/202] [ae-patch] Show the slot count on the installed app's
 icon

The sidebar's Dashboard n/3 row calls the Badging API (navigator.setAppBadge)
whenever the count changes and clears it at zero, so a Home Screen install
shows the working-session count on its icon. On iOS 16.4 and later this
needs notification permission, which upstream already requests for its idle
notifications. No upstream file changes: the logic is web/src/lib/aeAppBadge.ts
and one effect in AeSlotsPill.tsx.
